   "he": "אָכַל מַעֲשֵׂר שֵׁנִי בִּירוּשָׁלַיִם. כֵּיוָן דְּכִי אוֹרְחֵיהּ הוּא קָא אָכֵיל לֵיהּ, לָא מִמְּשִׁיךְ.",
   "en": "§ The mishna teaches that if he «ate second tithe in Jerusalem» he is not liable as a stubborn and rebellious son. The Gemara explains: «Since he eats» the second tithe «in the normal way,» i.e., as he is commanded, in Jerusalem, «he will not be drawn» to sin."
  }
